WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

1
00:00:01.740 --> 00:00:05.920
Every great story... had a day it began.

2
00:00:05.960 --> 00:00:11.380
And in Bahrain... our story began in a small woodworking workshop.

3
00:00:11.420 --> 00:00:14.880
Papers, pencils and ideas...

4
00:00:14.920 --> 00:00:19.320
and hands that believed ambition is greater than means.

5
00:00:19.360 --> 00:00:22.660
All we had was passion, determination,

6
00:00:22.700 --> 00:00:26.420
and the desire to make something different.

7
00:00:26.460 --> 00:00:29.840
The dream grew... and the responsibility grew with it.

8
00:00:29.880 --> 00:00:34.540
From a small workshop... to two integrated factories,

9
00:00:34.580 --> 00:00:38.920
equipped with the latest European machinery and technologies.

10
00:00:40.060 --> 00:00:44.160
And from a small team... to more than five branches,

11
00:00:44.200 --> 00:00:49.100
and a presence that reaches Saudi Arabia, Qatar and the UAE.

12
00:00:49.140 --> 00:00:51.160
And from an idea on paper...

13
00:00:51.200 --> 00:00:55.340
to more than ten thousand projects we have delivered,

14
00:00:55.380 --> 00:00:59.580
leaving our mark on our clients' homes and projects.

15
00:00:59.620 --> 00:01:06.320
But for us... success was never just business expansion.

16
00:01:06.360 --> 00:01:10.540
It was a greater responsibility, and greater aspirations.

17
00:01:10.580 --> 00:01:15.020
We invested in people, in quality, and in safety.

18
00:01:15.180 --> 00:01:20.480
And we embraced governance, international standards, and process development.

19
00:01:21.240 --> 00:01:24.620
And today... we step into a new phase.

20
00:01:24.660 --> 00:01:28.320
A phase in which we connect design with manufacturing,

21
00:01:28.360 --> 00:01:33.040
factories with supply chains, projects with management,

22
00:01:33.080 --> 00:01:38.180
and every detail of the work, in one integrated digital system.

23
00:01:38.220 --> 00:01:43.020
From the first idea... to the last detail of the project.

24
00:01:43.060 --> 00:01:45.280
Our journey began in Bahrain...

25
00:01:45.320 --> 00:01:49.160
and from Bahrain we continue to build the future.

26
00:01:49.380 --> 00:01:51.640
The Closets International.

27
00:01:51.700 --> 00:01:54.020
An ambition that started small...

28
00:01:54.060 --> 00:01:57.480
and an industry that looks toward something greater.

